### Build artifacts
src/bld/
dist/
# Self-contained browser bundle copied into the demo by rollup (output of `npm run build`,
# alongside dist/ above). Regenerated on every build, so it must not be tracked — it churns.
# NOTE: the website/static/demo copy is intentionally NOT ignored — the docs Pages deploy
# (docs.yml) serves that committed copy and does not rebuild it.
demos/browser/js/pptxgen.bundle.js
demos/browser/js/pptxgen.bundle.js.map

### Docusaurus build artifacts (the docs site lives under website/, which has its own .gitignore)
/build/
/.docusaurus/

### Editors
.idea/
*.swp
*~

### Autoloop
# Use .autoloop/* (not .autoloop/) so the negation below actually applies —
# git cannot re-include a file inside an excluded directory.
.autoloop/*
!.autoloop/bug-report.md

### OOXML-Validator binary (downloaded by tools/ooxml-validator/install.sh)
tools/ooxml-validator/bin/

### Release-test ephemeral artefacts (saved downloads, intermediate .pptx files)
test/release/_artifacts/
test/release/_tmp/
!.autoloop/profiles/
!.autoloop/profiles/**
